<div class="about-section">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-header">
      <h1>About Tutorx</h1>
      <p class="about-subtitle">Empowering learners worldwide through innovative education technology</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          At Tutorx, we believe that quality education should be accessible to everyone, everywhere.
          Our mission is to democratize learning by providing a comprehensive platform that connects
          learners with expert educators and cutting-edge educational resources.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Vision</h2>
        <p>
          We envision a world where geographical boundaries, economic constraints, and time limitations
          no longer hinder access to quality education. Through our innovative platform, we're building
          bridges between knowledge and those who seek it.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <ul class="features-list">
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Comprehensive course catalog across multiple disciplines</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Interactive learning assessments and progress tracking</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Expert instructors and industry professionals</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Community-driven learning environment</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Personalized learning paths and recommendations</li>
          <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Mobile-friendly platform for learning on the go</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Our Impact</h2>
        <p>
          Since our founding, Tutorx has transformed the lives of over 100,000 learners across 25 countries.
          Our students have successfully transitioned into new careers, advanced in their current roles, and
          expanded their knowledge horizons. We're proud to have facilitated over 500,000 course completions
          and maintained an average student satisfaction rating of 4.8 out of 5 stars.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Team</h2>
        <p>
          Tutorx was founded by a team of passionate educators and technologists who recognized the need
          for a more accessible and engaging learning experience. Our diverse team brings together expertise
          in education, technology, design, and business to create a platform that truly serves learners' needs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">100,000+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Active Learners</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">500,000+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Course Completions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">25+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Countries Served</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">4.8/5</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Student Rating</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-section">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">Join Our Learning Community</h2>
      <p class="text-xl mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-white">
        Start your learning journey today with Tutorx and unlock your potential.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <%= link_to "Get Started", courses_path, class: "bg-white text-purple-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors" %>
        <%= link_to "Contact Us", "#", class: "bg-white text-purple-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
